    <briefdescription>
<para>Mutual-TLS credential bundle for gRPC channel creation. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This path is fail-closed: the adapter will only create a secure gRPC channel when all three PEM fields are present and valid. Missing material is rejected unless <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1transaction_1_1_mtls_config_1a526388edc334be92d87bc392dd603369" kindref="member">allow_insecure</ref></computeroutput> is explicitly set for a local test-only override.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>For production deployments populate from files or a secret manager — never hard-code PEM material in source code. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
